{"id":"15698750acc82ec9","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-model-completion-qe.md","title":"Quantifier Elimination and Universal-Base Completion","display":"thm-model-completion-qe — Quantifier Elimination and Universal-Base Completion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-model-completion-qe","aliases":["17-thm-model-completion-qe"],"display":"thm-model-completion-qe — Quantifier Elimination and Universal-Base Completion","depends_on":["[[17-df-model-completeness]]","[[17-df-universal-consequences]]","[[17-df-model-completion]]","[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]","[[17-df-quantifier-elimination]]","[[17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Proposition 3.5.19","source_pages_print":[202,203],"source_pages_djvu":[218,219],"source_verification":"statement and compactness/diagram proof compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local QE convention retained; local extension to inconsistent theories disclosed","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-model-completion-qe"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-model-completion-qe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-model-completion-qe — Quantifier Elimination and Universal-Base Completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bb6e1781f34c54a\" href=\"?note=1bb6e1781f34c54a\" title=\"17-df-universal-consequences\">17-df-universal-consequences</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"31695c838dded93c\" href=\"?note=31695c838dded93c\" title=\"17-df-model-completion\">17-df-model-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5b4c86c70dd29331\" href=\"?note=5b4c86c70dd29331\" title=\"17-df-embedding-amalgamation\">17-df-embedding-amalgamation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e318e28bff8754a3\" href=\"?note=e318e28bff8754a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d868412e4c7fb403\" href=\"?note=d868412e4c7fb403\" title=\"17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation\">17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Proposition 3.5.19"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>202</span><span>203</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span><span>219</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement and compactness/diagram proof compared in supplied DjVu OCR; local QE convention retained; local extension to inconsistent theories disclosed"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\forall\">\\(T_\\forall\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1bb6e1781f34c54a\" href=\"?note=1bb6e1781f34c54a\" title=\"17-df-universal-consequences\">17-df-universal-consequences</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"31695c838dded93c\" href=\"?note=31695c838dded93c\" title=\"17-df-model-completion\">17-df-model-completion</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5b4c86c70dd29331\" href=\"?note=5b4c86c70dd29331\" title=\"17-df-embedding-amalgamation\">17-df-embedding-amalgamation</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e318e28bff8754a3\" href=\"?note=e318e28bff8754a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a> 的全赋值语义定义；量词自由式允许无用自由变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T,T_\\forall)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T_\\forall)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T,T_\\forall)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T)\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\Bigl[\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T,T_\\forall)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T_\\forall)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T,T_\\forall)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Proposition 3.5.19，印刷 pp.202–203、DjVu 218–219，陈述与证明已对照 OCR。这里的基理论是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\forall\">\\(T_\\forall\\)</span>，不是任意与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 共全称后承的理论；省略这一点会把“模型完备化必有量词消去”错误地外推。</p>\n<p>第一等价由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\forall\">\\(T_\\forall\\)</span> 共全称后承及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d868412e4c7fb403\" href=\"?note=d868412e4c7fb403\" title=\"17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation\">17-thm-model-completion-amalgamation</a> 得到。第二等价的正向利用生成子结构的图示完全性：两个元组有相同无量词类型时，其生成子结构同构，因而全类型相同；紧致性把全部无量词后承缩为一个有限合取。反向在加入任意一族名字后沿用量词消去；两个满足同一图示的模型满足相同无量词句，故满足相同全部句。</p>\n<p>无常元语言下，恒真或恒假的句子可用带无用变量的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x\">\\(x=x\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(x=x)\">\\(\\neg(x=x)\\)</span> 表示；一般句子的无量词等价式仍可含无用自由变量。本条沿用既有 QE 约定，不强求输出是无量词句子。</p>\n<p>一致性约定：原书印刷 p.186（DjVu 202）的模型完全性定义限于一致理论；本条沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a> 的本地谓词，保留不一致时的空真延拓。故来源对应在一致理论上按原书理解；不一致边界由模型类为空另行核对，不把该延拓冒称原书定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-universal-consequences","status":"resolved","id":"1bb6e1781f34c54a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-universal-consequences]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completion","status":"resolved","id":"31695c838dded93c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-embedding-amalgamation","status":"resolved","id":"5b4c86c7